Package: ragnar-raven
Version: 0.1.7
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jörg Schröder <projekt@lieraos.local>
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libgtk4-layer-shell0, libc6, libglib2.0-0t64, libcanberra0
Description: Ragnar sidebar: appointments, reminders and notifications
 Rust/GTK4 reimplementation of Raven. Runs as a background reminder
 daemon (autostart) and opens a compact day window on demand.
 Notification sidebar for the Ragnar desktop.
